  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>WF-create_tables
Creates every table, view and sequence of the project that is not there yet (CREATE ... IF NOT EXISTS),
in the order their foreign keys need. Safe to run again: it never empties or changes a table.
It also creates the 24 OMOP CDM 5.4 tables the project needs. Load the vocabulary into them once,
after the first run of this workflow and before WF-load_all (see README).</note>
